OL,3,ARussell Brand accuser said alleged rape
OL,4,A'really hurt', court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FStatements from the woman's parents
OL,7,Fwere also heard in court, saying their
OL,8,Fdaughter had told them about the
OL,9,Falleged attack, and that she had been
OL,10,F"very worried about HIV".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
