OL,3,ATwo European women held captive for
OL,4,Amore than a year in Niger freed in
OL,5,ALibya
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo women - a Swiss and an Austrian `
OL,8,Fhave been freed after more than a year
OL,9,Fin captivity in Niger and handed over
OL,10,Fto authorities in the Libyan city of
OL,11,FBenghazi.
OL,13,FAustrian national Eva Gretzmacher, 76,
OL,14,Fand Swiss Claudia Abbt, 69, were
OL,15,Fkidnapped separately in the northern
OL,16,FNigerien city of Agadez in January and
OL,17,FApril last year.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
