OL,3,ATwo European women held captive for
OL,4,Amore than a year in Niger freed in
OL,5,ALibya
OL,6,
OL,7,FNo details have been given about who
OL,8,Fwas holding them or their demands,
OL,9,Falthough some reports have previously
OL,10,Flinked the kidnapping to Islamic State
OL,11,Fmilitants. The circumstances of their
OL,12,Frelease were not disclosed.
OL,14,FThe Austrian and Swiss governments have
OL,15,Fboth confirmed the release of their
OL,16,Fcitizens.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
