OL,3,ATeacher in Oregon shooting said she
OL,4,Apretended to be dead to survive
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I did the only thing I could do, which
OL,7,Fwas to pretend to be dead in the hope
OL,8,Fhe would not shoot me again," Drury
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
